# Pipeline

Inspect and control pipelines using the `sdlc-orchestrator` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/sdlc-orchestrator/SKILL.md` and `commands/pipeline.md`.

## Usage
```
/pipeline
/pipeline resume pipe-m8x2k1
```

## Output
The pipeline state table — id, phase, statuses, scores, pending gates.

## Notes
Never restart a pipeline that has a checkpoint. Resume at the recorded phase.
